records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-07/2026-07-07t15-49-35z-cms-medicaid-total-enrollment-2027-04/parsed_cells.json:64:        "text": "Framing and exact resolver: this is the CMS preliminary Performance Indicator Data national total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment count for April 2027, converted to millions. I interpret the ledger target named cms.medicaid.total_enrollment as the CMS Medicaid and CHIP national total used on the official enrollment snapshot and Data.Medicaid.gov dataset; the series-name discrepancy is that the resolver includes CHIP rather than Medicaid-only enrollment. The target is a national total for the 50 states and DC, not a weighted average, state row, BHP count, or T-MSIS separate CHIP variant. I use the fixed-vintage first monthly print and ignore later revisions."
records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-07/2026-07-07t15-49-35z-cms-medicaid-total-enrollment-2027-04/parsed_cells.json:122:        "text": "Review disposition: accepted the resolver critique by explicitly flagging that the ledger series name says Medicaid total enrollment while this forecast resolves the CMS Medicaid and CHIP national total. Accepted the interval and update critiques by tying the +/-2.9 million band to drift, implementation, and first-print uncertainty components, and by stating the early community-engagement eligible-population implementation assumption. Kept the first-print rule unchanged."
