 deadline is in force on its statutory schedule and no federal statutory or regulatory delay has been announced by 2027-03-31. Ledger discrepancy note: this run verified the official monthly release vehicle and recent official snapshot release dates, but did not find a future-dated CMS April 2027 release placeholder; 2027-09-30 is retained as the canonical ledger deadline while the substantive resolver remains the first official print.","dataPointId":"cms.medicaid_chip.total_enrollment.2027_04.first_print.work_req_deadline_holds","conditionalOn":"The 2025 reconciliation law's Medicaid community-engagement compliance deadline takes effect on its statutory schedule, with no federal statutory or regulatory delay announced by 2027-03-31.","historicalContext":[{"label":"March 2026 total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment, millions","value":74.294361},{"label":"February 2026 total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment, millions","value":74.9},{"label":"January 2026 total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment, millions","value":75.3},{"label":"December 2025 total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment, millions","value":75.7},{"label":"October 2025 total Medicaid and CHIP enrollment, millions","value":76.8}],"drivers":["post-unwinding enrollment drift still negative in early 2026","January 1 2027 community-engagement requirement affects some adult Medicaid eligibility","April 2027 is early enough that state implementation lag limits full work-requirement losses","California March 2026 reporting revision lowers the latest national base","first-print preliminary Performance Indicator Data may differ from later updated files"],"sourceContext":["https://www.medicaid.gov/medicaid/program-information/medicaid-and-chip-enrollment-data/report-highlights","https://www.medicaid.gov/medicaid-and-chip-eligibility-operations-and-enrollment-snapshot","https://data.medicaid.gov/dataset/6165f45b-ca93-5bb5-9d06-db29c692a360","https://www.medicaid.gov/resources-for-states/downloads/eligib-oper-and-enrol-snap-mar2026.pdf","h